msgid "FullCone NAT"
msgstr "全锥形 NAT"

msgid "Using FullCone NAT can improve gaming performance effectively."
msgstr "使用全锥形 NAT 可以有效提升游戏体验。"

msgid "IPv6 Full Cone NAT"
msgstr "IPv6 全锥形 NAT"

msgid "Enabling IPv6 Full Cone NAT adds an extra layer of NAT to IPv6. In IPv6, if you obtain an IPv6 prefix through IPv6 Prefix Delegation, each device can be assigned a public IPv6 address, eliminating the need for IPv6 Full Cone NAT."
msgstr "启用 IPv6 的全锥形 NAT 会给 IPv6 增加一层 NAT。对于 IPv6 来说，如果通过 IPv6 前缀代理 (IPv6-PD) 获取到了 IPv6 前缀，则本身每个设备都可以分配一个公网 IPv6 地址，无需开启 IPv6 全锥形 NAT。"

msgid "Using BBR CCA can improve TCP network performance effectively."
msgstr "使用 BBR 拥塞控制算法可以有效提升 TCP 网络性能。"